# Keep the Docker build context small AND clean.
#
# bin/ and obj/ matter most: they hold build output from your Windows machine.
# Copying them into a Linux build makes the build fail with confusing "path not
# found" errors, because they record absolute Windows paths.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/node_modules/
.git/
.gitignore
tests/
*.user
*.suo
**/App_Data/
README.md
openapi.json
build.sh
